<title>UK: Int'l Endesa sets 25 bln yen dual currency bond.</title>
<headline>Int'l Endesa sets 25 bln yen dual currency bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Daiwa Europe Ltd.</p>
<p> BORROWER   INTERNATIONAL ENDESA</p>
<p>GUARANTOR  EMPRESA NACIONAL DE ELECTRICIDAD SA</p>
<p> AMT   *25 BLN YEN    COUPON     5.0 PCT   MATURITY    18.SEP.00</p>
<p> TYPE  DUAL-CURRENCY  ISS PRICE  100.0     PAY DATE  S-18.MAR.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.50	LISTING    NONE	PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> NOTES	*DUAL CURRENCY, COUPON PAYABLE IN YEN, REDEMPTION IN</p>
<p>		 U.S. DOLLARS</p>
<p>	     S-SHORT FIRST COUPON</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  AA2/AA    DENOMS (K) 500	 SALE LIMITS **</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  =	   TAX PROVS   GROSS-UP</p>
<p> NOTES	**US/UK/JP/NL/ES</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
